{"server":"cn","storyId":"act35side_level_act35side_06_beg","groupId":"act35side","stageId":"act35side_06","title":"过往云烟","storyCode":"AS-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"f51951a83930d607c5492e6b38885953d2c230bbc191a9e55c50716d032d6d39","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g8_sargondeluxeroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"室内，空气因为酷暑而变得沉闷，女孩坐在桌前，一边翻着厚厚的资料，一边擦拭从额角流下的汗水。\n背后响起了脚步声，她知道有人进来了，但却懒得回头看。\n桌子上有扁桃仁，他会自己拿的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你在看什么书啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，下午太阳这么好，出去玩啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你不会打算钻在这堆落灰的莎草纸卷里一辈子吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我去请求父亲了，他说他会考虑让我成为黄金之城的史官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，做个帕夏也很好，放弃吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了！你小子别吵我了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩猛地回过头，却发现背后空无一人。\n只有她掷出的书卷，孤零零地躺在地板上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"佩佩，你在吗？快开门！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在，请进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给你的通讯器发了那么多消息，你为什么不回？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把通讯器关掉，在这里看了一晚上的书，发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，昨夜发生那么多事情，难不成你在这里一无所知吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个闷起头来做事的性子真的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我也不知道该说什么了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接听吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电台广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"米城内多个区域发生紧急事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电台广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有大量金属构装的人偶走上街头，从居民家中抢夺大量宝石后离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电台广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"据悉，已有众多市民向城市护卫队报告，护卫队队长表示正在追查中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金属人偶......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电台广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"据目击者透露，他曾于昨夜目睹这些金属构装人偶从本市博物馆中逃出......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......我想说的，她都说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿娜特说，博物馆的工作人员跟随着构装体的踪迹，最后找到了大巴扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是祖拜尔做的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们怀疑是这样，但是没人看到他，你和他相处时间最久，你能去找找看吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，我这就过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你和阿娜特呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为博物馆的管理人员，我们总得将文物尽数找回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们打算去街上看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩佩","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一有消息我就通知你们，回见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_4058_pepe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电台广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，慢着，本台插播一条急讯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电台广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有市民发现家中取水器内流出的水变得浑浊，其中掺杂大量泥沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电台广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"护卫队方面称，他们正在紧急组织人力排查城市老地下水通道，由于通道情况复杂，可能仍然需要时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅捷缇克缇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1478_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这又是什么情况？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......某人已经给我讲述过这里的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宝石繁荣了大巴扎，与香料、绸缎、工艺品一同源源不断地为这里带来财富。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借由宝石交易所，借由这些有着特殊源石回路的宝石，米纳特哈玛仪成为镶嵌在沙海中的一颗晨星......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"古老的建筑不断淌下黄沙，人们推开窗户或走出大门，惊异地看向自己祖祖辈辈生活的房屋，继而看向站在街道中央的祖拜尔。\n但祖拜尔却仿佛没有注意到他们。\n他俯身从黄沙中拾起一枚首饰，螺旋形金属框架正中的宝石在日光下熠熠生辉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖拜尔先生，您提起的壁画就在前方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的外祖父曾说过，墙上的图画描绘了古萨尔贡人的生活，记录着米纳特哈玛仪的诞生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“即便河水干涸，城市被掩埋在黄沙之下，它也不会褪色。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“不会褪色”，是的。就如同你我手中流过的每一颗宝石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，不是河水干涸，黄沙掩埋了昔日的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而是洪水毁去了那伟大建筑的顶端，黄沙深处掩埋的辉煌成了千年的秘密。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每一次日升月落，都是一个小轮回的重新演绎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"短暂的一天是如此，漫长的一生是如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"城市的枯荣，帝国的盛衰，大地的终始，亦是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，虽然壁画只能记载下万古之中的一瞬，但这一瞬同样会一遍遍轮回重演，这就是它的价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沙阿命人绘制这些壁画，并不是为了自己的名在轮回中留存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他要留下的是他对时间与生命的解释本身，在那之后，世人便有可以效仿的依据。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“过去与未来之王”在此地建设了他的宝库，于是他身后漫长的“阿斯兰战争”里，无数王酋觊觎此地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到极南的热风让气候发生巨变，这里迎来滔天洪水，城墙倾颓，河流改道，土地变得面目全非。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人们在黄沙中搜寻宝库的痕迹，却一无所获，于是他们开始相信，宝库已经随着洪水覆灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"王酋的寻宝队离开了，工匠和商人们来到这里，在河边建起了新的聚落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我始终看着这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我奉命守护这座宝库，这是我的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我徘徊在黄沙之中，历尽日升日落，拦阻那些窥探秘密的不轨之徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而你，年轻人，你应该比任何人都更加确定——沙阿宝库的本体，就在这座城市的地底。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g10_grandbazaar_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“第四颗代表肝脏，我们清醒着进入夜晚，为了职责与义务。”......感谢你归还的宝石，让我回忆起更多往事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最初，成千上万的能工巧匠来到一片荒芜的米纳特哈玛仪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上至奇伟的黄金机关迷宫，下至手工雕琢的源石回路宝石，工匠们创造了一切，然后将它们埋入黄沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后世的人们大都相信，在耗尽心血的作业之后，所有的工匠也都被埋葬在了他们的造物身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但实际上，仍有一些工匠隐居在米纳特哈玛仪西南的一处村落，世代保守着“宝库入口在何地”的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该你来说了，年轻人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的事情，便与你的家族有关了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"年轻的监管人紧闭双目，似乎被沉重的记忆之沙淹没。\n那段故事经过世代流传，已经成为高悬于思绪荒漠上空的烈日，仰首便可望见。\n蒸腾着。炙烤着。煎熬着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......三百年前，许多帕夏王酋集结的军队找到了那个村子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们向村民们逼问宝库的入口，坚持守密的人都被砍去了双手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为不忍村民们继续受害，一位失去双手的宝石工匠主动找上王酋军，提出要为他们引路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在宝库前，他见证了王酋军与宝库守护者的激战，看到守护者虽然被打败，但没有他的法术，宝库的大门便不会开启。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愤怒的王酋军剖开了守护者的胸膛，刮下了他身体内外镶嵌的每一颗宝石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管那位告密的工匠用尽所知的技术，指导自己年幼的孩子去修复守护者的身躯，但守护者终究没有醒来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......然后，米纳特哈玛仪的大巴扎立起了一架天平。那个工匠的孩子在成人之后安葬了守护者，又设立了一间宝石交易所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从那以后，他的后人一直在这里等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一代先祖都竭尽所能，让米纳特哈玛仪的宝石贸易更加繁荣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百年千年，终有一日，人们能淘尽萨尔贡的黄沙，宝石会聚在这座城市......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉恕尔","speakerId":"avg_4140_lasher_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我能够将它们还给您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"感觉到叉铃抵上胸膛，监管人不敢睁开双眼。\n但在他的眼前，却仿佛有数百年的时光在瞬间流淌而过。\n日升月落，物换星移。监管人看到一座座城市兴荣，复又消亡，眼前的建筑缓慢地化为沙砾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"监管人看到一位古老的守护者行走在无边际的沙漠中。\n守护者张开双臂，沐浴在繁星的光芒之下，面向东方等待着日出。\n感知到有人在看自己，他垂下视线迎向监管人的目光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在守护者悲悯的注视中，监管人不禁颤抖。\n为他即将吐露的话语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......多么漫长的时光啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们自由了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"53_g12_gemexchange"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见了，二位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去数百年，我有失于自己的职责，但如今我已重返人世，我将同这座城市一起，赎还我们欠下的时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与此同时，我还有一个请求，希望二位能够答应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那位梦魇当真是哈兰杜汗的后裔，我将应沙阿之诺，为她打开宝库。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃奥，请确认她的血脉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交由我便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我仍然需要对她进行一番考验，若她最终无法走上天途，注定不算是合格的梦魇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，让她踏出那一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1483_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会也要一起去吧？我对那些梦魇可没有什么好感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们中的酒鬼含量实在是太高了，把酒液洒得到处都是，我可不想费心再去舔自己的皮毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，米奥，您需要帮我完成另外一项事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说吧，年轻人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我陷入沉睡之后，沙阿的宝库遭受了如此严重的破坏，这是我的失职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不得不承认，即使有构装体在侧协助，我的力量也无法与王酋帕夏集结的军队相抗衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我你的决定，我会为你做到，一如既往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我遇到了一个孩子，我觉得她能帮我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她追寻着沙阿离去的足迹，找到了我流失在外的宝石，没有她我无法苏醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你是说那个孩子吗？我见过她，很不错的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上进，活泼，就是有些执拗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我想起了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，当我寻回自己的记忆后，那女孩的行为举止都令我感到熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一如当年，我与姐姐漫步在黄金之城的街巷中，那里的一砖一瓦，她都清楚它们的来由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对那些上了年头的东西，她总是格外着迷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要那女孩为你做什么，祖拜尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要一个同伴，与我共同等候沙阿的归来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祖拜尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1479_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米奥，请为我确认，她是否合格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，祖拜尔，如果那是你的愿望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
